00:04:36.036 --> 00:04:41.356
Russia's Cosmos 2612 satellite has changed its path multiple times to approach a United

00:04:41.356 --> 00:04:46.336
United States registered commercial radar imaging satellite, ICI-EX-36.

00:04:46.916 --> 00:04:51.396
The Hindu International presents the maneuvers as part of ongoing space-domain awareness

00:04:51.396 --> 00:04:55.716
