00:05:04.372 --> 00:05:09.032
Firefighters have made progress worth knowing against a Southern California wildfire driven

00:05:09.032 --> 00:05:10.232
by Santa Ana Wins.

00:05:10.232 --> 00:05:15.692
A.P. News reports that crews have established better control lines, and officials have

00:05:15.692 --> 00:05:18.472
